# =====================================================================
# Rotating Residential Proxies Configuration
# =====================================================================
# Add your rotating proxy addresses below (one per line).
# Lines beginning with # are comments and will be ignored.
#
# Supported formats:
#   http://username:password@proxy.provider.com:port
#   http://ip:port
#   socks5://username:password@proxy.provider.com:port
#
# Examples (Webshare, BrightData, Oxylabs, Smartproxy):
# http://customer-user-cc-us:pass123@pr.oxylabs.io:7777
# http://user:secret@gate.smartproxy.com:7000
# http://p.webshare.io:80
#
# Alternatively, you can also set the environment variable:
# YTDLP_PROXIES="http://user:pass@proxy1:port,http://user:pass@proxy2:port"
